  "description": "DOWMIM crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group C c c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C112 H252 Cl1 Nd4 O48 Si28 1-,Na1 1+. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd1A (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd1G (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd1F (Nd) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.617-3.665 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.05-98.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula {[(i-C4H9)7(Si7O12)Nd]4NaCl}.",
